<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93You will,\'94 Eloise replied evenly. \'93The application is legally binding. You submitted it voluntarily. What else do you want? Kathy and Hayley in prison for drug abuse and committing crimes under the Food Preservation Secrets Act?\'94 She let that settle, then added more gently, \'93Or perhaps you\'92d prefer to tell me what you actually want?\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah\'92s jaw worked. Her eyes burned, but behind the fury, Eloise could see the wheels turning. Finally, Sarah spoke.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93I want Kathy as my personal physician for life.\'94\
